title: Reaching Out
new-page: true
view-if: erc_reachout_timer <= 0 and player_party = "erc"
on-arrival: {! 
    Q.month_actions += 1; 
    Q.erc_reachout_timer = 9; 
    Q.party_reaching_out_map = 1;

    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_rest = false;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_catalonia = false;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_eh = true;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_ppcc = true;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_galicia = true;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_viewed_others = false;
    Q.congreso_party_tour_highlight = ["galicia", "ppcc", "eh", "catalonia"];
!}
max-visits: 36
is-card: true
card-image: img/erc/ararepubliques.jpg
# face-image: img/erc/ararepubliques.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: erc_party jxsi_party jxcat_party
role: card-party

= Reaching Out

Across the Spanish state, many share in our struggle. Be others also fighting for independence or, more broadly, for decentralization and republicanism, we're hardly alone. It's always a good idea to reach out and help each other.

{!<div id="congreso-party-tour-widget" style="width: 95%; margin: 0 auto;"></div>!}

- @bng_reach
- @pnv_reach
- @ehbildu_reach
- @gbai_reach
- @amaiur_reach
- @compromis_reach
- @mes_reach
- @return: We don't need to reach out to any of them at the moment
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@bng_reach
title: Reach out to the BNG
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: party_resources -= 1

We have collaborated and talked before with the BNG, as we share many points in leftist thinking, independence, and republicanism. What should we focus on this time?

-@campaign_bng
-@push_bng
-@pull_bng

@campaign_bng
title: Campaign together with the BNG
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.podemos_surged) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "bng", "galicia", "3", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "2", "podemos");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "bng", "galicia", "3", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "3", "iu");
    }
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "bng", "galicia", "3", "psoe");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "bng", "galicia", "1", "pp");
    if (Q.psc_split) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psc");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psoe");
    }  
!}

Building bridges across state-less nations is always something that draws people into our cause. Let's hope this makes a difference!

- @clean_map


@push_bng
title: Talk the BNG into collaborating with [? if iu_in_up: UP ?][? if not iu_in_up: Podemos ?]
view-if: podemos_surged
choose-if: party_reaching_out_bng > -2
unavailable-subtitle: We've already done everything in our hand to bring them as close as possible.
on-arrival: {!
    Q[Q.parlament_current_icv + "_relations"] += 5;
    Q["cup_relations"] -=3;
    Q.cat_spa_relations += 1;
    Q.party_reaching_out_bng -= 1;

    Q.independence_trust -= 3;

    if (Q.spa_cup_active) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "cup", "catalunya", "1", "erc");
    } else if (Q.spa_fr_active) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "fr", "catalunya", "1", "erc");
    }
!}

We've tried our best to build bridges and set up talks between them and [? if iu_in_up: UP?][? if not iu_in_up: Podemos?]. We'll have to see if that's enough for them to run together in the next election, though.

- @clean_map


@pull_bng
title: Talk the BNG into running independently from [? if iu_in_up: UP ?][? if not iu_in_up: Podemos ?]
view-if: podemos_surged 
choose-if: party_reaching_out_bng < 2
unavailable-subtitle: We've already done everything in our hand to prop up their independence.
on-arrival: {!
    Q[Q.parlament_current_icv + "_relations"] -= 5;
    Q["cup_relations"] +=3;
    Q.cat_spa_relations -= 1;
    Q.party_reaching_out_bng += 1;
    
    Q.independence_trust += 1;
    if (Q.spa_cup_active) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "0.5", "cup");
    } else if (Q.spa_fr_active) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "0.5", "fr");
    }
!}

We've tried our best to highlight the need to have different political opinions between independence and sovereignty versus [? if iu_in_up: UP's ?][? if not iu_in_up: Podemos' ?] federalism. We'll have to see if that's enough for them to not run together in the next election, though.

- @clean_map


@pnv_reach
title: Campaign with EAJ-PNV
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.party_resources -= 1
    if (Q.podemos_surged) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "pnv", "euskadi", "2", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "podemos", "catalunya", "1", "erc");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "gbai", "navarra", "1", "podemos");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "pnv", "euskadi", "2", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "iu", "catalunya", "1", "erc");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "gbai", "navarra", "1", "iu");
    }
    if (Q.psc_split) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psc");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psoe");
    }
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "ciu");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "pnv", "euskadi", "1", "psoe");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "pnv", "euskadi", "2", "ehbildu");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "gbai", "navarra", "2", "ehbildu");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "gbai", "navarra", "1", "psoe");
!}

Campaigning with EAJ-PNV is an unusual move from our end. We do not really share that much on the social and economic fronts, but we do both represent aspirations for sovereignty and independence. The message sent is, nonetheless, mixed if not confusing.

- @clean_map


@ehbildu_reach
title: Campaign with ehbildu
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
view-if: spa_ehbildu_active
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
    // TODO: path for them joining UP? or too implausible?
    Q.party_resources -= 1;
    if (Q.podemos_surged) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "ehbildu", "euskadi", "3", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "2", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "ehbildu", "navarra", "1", "podemos");

    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "ehbildu", "euskadi", "3", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "ehbildu", "navarra", "1", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "3", "iu");
    }
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "ehbildu", "euskadi", "2", "psoe");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "ehbildu", "euskadi", "1", "pnv");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "ehbildu", "navarra", "1", "gbai");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "ehbildu", "navarra", "1", "psoe");
    if (Q.psc_split) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psc");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psoe");
    }
!}

Building bridges across state-less nations is always something that draws people into our cause. Let's hope this makes a difference!

- @clean_map


@gbai_reach
title: Campaign with gbai
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
    // TODO: path for them joining UP? or too implausible?
    Q.party_resources -= 1
    if (Q.podemos_surged) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "pnv", "euskadi", "1", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "gbai", "navarra", "3", "podemos");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "pnv", "euskadi", "1", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "gbai", "navarra", "4", "iu");
    }
    if (Q.psc_split) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psc");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psoe");
    }
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "ciu");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "pnv", "euskadi", "0.5", "psoe");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "pnv", "euskadi", "2", "ehbildu");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "gbai", "navarra", "3", "ehbildu");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "gbai", "navarra", "2", "psoe");
!}

The gbai coalition is a mix of regionalist and pro-independence parties in Navarre, ranging from centre-left to centre-right, including the Navarrese branch of EAJ-PNV. Campaigning with them is a tad unusual for us, but we do both represent aspirations for sovereignty and independence. 

- @clean_map


@amaiur_reach
title: Campaign with amaiur
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
view-if: not spa_ehbildu_active
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: {!
    Q.party_resources -= 1;
    if (Q.podemos_surged) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "amaiur", "euskadi", "4", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "4", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "amaiur", "navarra", "3", "podemos");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "amaiur", "euskadi", "5", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "amaiur", "navarra", "5", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "5", "iu");
    }
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "amaiur", "euskadi", "3", "psoe");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "amaiur", "euskadi", "1", "pnv");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "amaiur", "navarra", "1", "gbai");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "amaiur", "navarra", "3", "psoe");
    if (Q.psc_split) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "2", "psc");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "4", "psoe");
    }
!}

Campaiging together against the political repression and persecution of the Spanish state does send a powerful message.

- @clean_map


@compromis_reach
title: Reach out to compromis
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: party_resources -= 1

compromis is a relatively new coalition of broadly regionalist, federalist, republican, social-democratic, left parties in Valencia. While not explicitly pro-independece, the shared language, struggle against Spanish centralization and nationalism, and a long etc does bring us close together. What should we focus on in our reaching out?

-@campaign_compromis
-@push_compromis
-@pull_compromis

@campaign_compromis
title: Campaign together with compromis
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.podemos_surged) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "compromis", "valencia", "4", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "2", "podemos");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "compromis", "valencia", "3", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "3", "iu");
    }
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "compromis", "valencia", "2.5", "psoe");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "compromis", "valencia", "1", "pp");  
    if (Q.psc_split) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "psc");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1.5", "psoe");
    }
!}

Campaigning in Valencia is never easy, as the right is relentless in calling for a defence against the supposed "pancatalanist" "hypernationalist" threat. Nonethless, the overall feeling is positive. 

- @clean_map


