@mes_reach
title: Reach out to MES
subtitle: \[-1 resources\]
choose-if: party_resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: party_resources -= 1

MES is a small group, but we do have many shared fights with them, like those on Catalan & Balearic identity, wealth redistribution, and republicanism. What should we focus on this time?

-@campaign_mes
-@push_mes
-@pull_mes

@campaign_mes
title: Campaign together with MES
on-arrival: {!
    if (Q.podemos_surged) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "mes", "balears", "3", "podemos");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "1", "podemos");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "mes", "balears", "3", "iu");
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "2", "iu");
    }
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "mes", "balears", "2", "psoe");
    G.spaSupportInject(Q, "mes", "balears", "0.5", "pp");  
    if (Q.psc_split) {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "0.5", "psc");
    } else {
        G.spaSupportInject(Q, "erc", "catalunya", "0.5", "psoe");
    }
!}

While a bit unbalanced as our party size difference is not small, MES can clearly benefit from extra resources and organization for their campaign.

- @clean_map


